; Settings-only DDF picked up by convention (same base name as the project).
; CompressionType=MSZIP is a distinctive, easily-asserted override of whatever
; ZipadeeCompressionLevel would otherwise compute - CabDdfTests checks the generated
; obj\...\StubArchiveWithDdf.ddf actually contains this line.
.Set CompressionType=MSZIP
; Exercises the "ZipadeeMaxVolumeSize always overwrites a user DDF's own MaxDiskSize,
; with a warning" scenario in CabDdfTests.
.Set MaxDiskSize=0
